    {
      "id": "4HKc1_dY43SHjXGV6RLNr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 465.94264896088305,
      "y": 555.2157629366897,
      "width": 510.1796875,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b01",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1109708929,
      "version": 520,
      "versionNonce": 314656371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779560191670,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "loop w l\n    loop w r = l -> l+k+1\n        if *r==*l, skip 1, allow 1 more (add 1 to bound)\n        if ending char != *l, count-=1\n\noh shit this is O(n²) worst case lol nvm\nwait or is it\ncause if k=n, then u only need to ever iterate once. \nafter l=0, you cant beat it anymore\nso then its actually O(1) for that case\nbut for avg case like AABABBA, hmmm\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "loop w l\n    loop w r = l -> l+k+1\n        if *r==*l, skip 1, allow 1 more (add 1 to bound)\n        if ending char != *l, count-=1\n\noh shit this is O(n²) worst case lol nvm\nwait or is it\ncause if k=n, then u only need to ever iterate once. \nafter l=0, you cant beat it anymore\nso then its actually O(1) for that case\nbut for avg case like AABABBA, hmmm\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
