    {
      "id": "XSA_Kpxefw68jo2I7yHMt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 993.9745101588493,
      "y": 646.6451822542482,
      "width": 351.86690211161965,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2093670287,
      "version": 461,
      "versionNonce": 629098429,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779560191670,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we wanna put a condition on the l\nloop that l < size - maxlen, because\nif l >= size - maxlen, then the\nremaining space to put a window is\nsmaller than the max we've alr got\nso actually we can just loop from l\nto size - maxlen instead of l to\nsize",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we wanna put a condition on the l loop that l < size - maxlen, because if l >= size - maxlen, then the remaining space to put a window is smaller than the max we've alr got\nso actually we can just loop from l to size - maxlen instead of l to size",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "to1SBSinQfG89IKwZW3u-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 889.6213390388215,
      "y": 951.8835510989403,
      "width": 376.80873494626894,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1965016271,
      "version": 895,
      "versionNonce": 1791483539,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779560191670,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so here on the first one it would go\nall the way to the end and say maxlen\n= 7\nthen since size - maxlen = 7-7 = 0, it\nstops there",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so here on the first one it would go all the way to the end and say maxlen = 7\nthen since size - maxlen = 7-7 = 0, it stops there",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
